\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:lit-ctc}{{1}{2}{The two CTC operations used in this project. (a)~Collapsing the emitted path gives the transcription, so a line can be trained from its text alone with no character boundaries. (b)~Given the text, forced alignment finds the most probable block of time steps for each character; the dashed lines are the resulting territories, from which individual letter shapes are cut. Blank symbols are shaded}{figure.caption.1}{}}
