\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {22}{\ignorespaces Scalar values of the thirteen stored style profiles, read directly from the files in \texttt  {Software/CNN/NOGIT/StyleProfiles10}: kept lines, slant, pixel x-height, stroke width (x-heights), ascender $A$ and descender $D$ and word gap (x-heights), connectedness, legibility parameter $\lambda $, number of characters and number of variants. Writers 150 to 588 are database writers, the last five are the personal writers. $^\dagger  $The $\lambda $ column is \emph  {not} read from these files: the key \texttt  {legibilityLambda} is absent from every one of them, and the values shown are the output of an earlier tuning run that predates the current profiles; abhinav, owen and thiya were added afterwards and were never tuned. An earlier version of this table listed ten writers and the scalar values of a superseded build.}}{100}{table.caption.95}\protected@file@percent }
